/T (This teaches us a fundamental principle: True service of God does not require withdrawal from the world. The sacred and the mundane need not be separated. Rather, we are called to bring holiness into the world, to see every act of kindness and every human interaction as an opportunity to cleave to God's ways.)
/E (This teaches us a fundamental principle: True service of God does not require withdrawal from the world. The sacred and the mundane need not be separated. Rather, we are called to bring holiness into the world, to see every act of kindness and every human interaction as an opportunity to cleave to God's ways.)
