/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (On this special 10-year anniversary, we want to thank the Rabbis and administration for a decade of dedication, guidance, and love. You have taught not only Torah, but also a love for Am Yisrael and Eres Yisrael. You have treated every boy as your own, and our family has seen the lifelong impact of your devotion. May you continue to inspire and shape generations of young men who will carry the light of Torah and the love of Israel wherever they go.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [12 13]
